Screen Open 0,320,200,8,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Print #1,Joy(1);Fire(1);Amos Here
Amos To Back : Wait 25 : Print #1,Amos Here;Joy(0);Fire(0)
Amos To Front : Wait 25 : Print #1,Amos Here
Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/a" : Close 9
Repeat : Wait Vbl : Until Mouse Key
Print #1,Fire(0);Joy(0) and 16
Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/b" : Close 9
Repeat : Wait Vbl : Until Mouse Key=0
Print #1,Fire(0);Joy(0) and 16
